## Verdict

Only **Agent** gets an explicit tool catalog. **DeepResearch** never tells the model which search providers are configured—it runs Exa/Brave/Perplexity unconditionally and pastes results/errors into the corpus. **Chat** gets no system prompt about tools or research. Agent has **no** Exa/Brave/Perplexity/Finnhub tools.

