## Verdict

The scroll lock is almost certainly the **unconditional auto-scroll** in `App.tsx`. Every streaming delta (and every DeepResearch todo update) forces `scrollTop = scrollHeight`, so once content overflows the viewport you cannot scroll up. There is **no** `use-stick-to-bottom` (or other scroll library) — just this naive effect. A secondary CSS risk is `body { overflow: hidden }` with flex/grid height and no `min-height: 0` on the chat flex child.

