## 2. Auto-scroll / stick-to-bottom (primary bug)

`apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/App.tsx`:

```322:325:apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/App.tsx
useEffect(() => {
  const el = scrollRef.current;
  if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
}, [messages, busy, todos]);
```

Problems:
- No "near bottom?" check — any upward scroll is overwritten on the next update.
- Depends on `messages` — every stream `delta` rewrites content → effect → snap to bottom.
- Depends on `todos` — DeepResearch `todo_update` events also snap scroll.
- Depends on `busy` — start/end of a run also forces bottom.

Streaming path that keeps firing this (same file):

```172:185:apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/App.tsx
if (ev.event === "delta") {
  const aid = streamAssistantId.current;
  if (!aid) return;
  setMessages((prev) =>
    prev.map((m) => {
      if (m.id !== aid) return m;
      return {
        ...m,
        content: ev.content ? m.content + ev.content : m.content,
        reasoning: ev.reasoning ? (m.reasoning ?? "") + ev.reasoning : m.reasoning,
        streaming: true,
      };
    }),
