### Scatter series fixes
- **Correct Y mapping** — Points now use Recharts' `y` field so all dots in a series render at the right coordinates (not stacked on one spot).
- **Series-based colors** — Points with the same series name share a color; changing one point's series color updates all points in that series.
- **Better defaults** — New scatter charts start with **Series A** (3 points) and **Series B** (3 points).
- **Add Point** — New points inherit the current series name and get sensible X/Y offsets.
- **Series autocomplete** — The style panel suggests existing series names when typing.

### How to use
1. Set the same **Series** name on multiple points (e.g. `Series A`).
2. Give each point its own **X** and **Y**.
3. Click **Add Point** to add more dots to the active series.

