## Protocol overview (aligned)

`workers/ms_protocol.py` emits line-delimited `MSJSON:` + JSON with types `progress`, `log`, `result`. Progress uses camelCase `outputPath` when `output_path=` is passed; extra kwargs stay snake_case (`examples_done`, `eta_sec`, etc.). `engine/bin/modelstudio-engine.js` parses all three types and maps snake_case progress fields to camelCase for the UI.

`engine/lib/inference_server.js` does **not** parse MSJSON—it only forwards inference-server process lines to `notify('log')`. That is expected (not a worker).

