## 3. SFT model selection & configuration

**Selection**

- Catalog dropdown (hardware-ranked) + free-text HF id override.
- Default catalog (UI + `hw_recommend.MODEL_CATALOG`):
  - `google/gemma-4-E2B-it`, `google/gemma-4-E4B-it`
  - `Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct`, `Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B`
  - `google/gemma-4-12B-it`
- Probe: Settings → Probe / open Model tab → `hw_recommend.py --json` tiers models (`recommended` / `ok` / `stretch` / `not_recommended`).
- Saving `modelId` triggers `prefetchBaseModel()` into sibling `ModelStudio-bases/`.

**Config** (~79% of knobs in UI → `project.json`)

Stored in `defaultProject()` (`engine\lib\projects.js`): `quantMode`, `peftMethod`, `hwOptimize`, epochs, LR, batch, accum, seq len, LoRA r/α/dropout, merge, warmup, WD, scheduler, optim, seed, packing, logging/save, precision, grad checkpoint, maxSamples, NEFTune, etc.

UI: `renderer\index.html` Model tab + `saveModelSettings()` in `renderer\app.js`.

Default PEFT: **`auto` → QDoRA** (DoRA + rsLoRA on 4-bit when possible). See `docs\PEFT_AND_HARDWARE.md`.

