## Verdict
SFT is a text-only chat pipeline. Datasets are `.jsonl` / `.parquet` only, copied flat into the project `data/` folder, normalized to `{"messages":[{"role","content"}]}`, then passed as `--data-folder` to `train_sft.py`. Multimodal list `content` is stringified to text; image/video/audio appear only in RLHF inference attachments, not in SFT training.

## End-to-end flow
UI (Data tab drop/browse) → `projects.importData` → `{exportRoot}/projects/{id}/data/*.jsonl|parquet` → `project.json` (dataFolder, dataFiles, dataExampleCount) → `projects.startSft` → `train_sft.py --data-folder` → `load_folder_as_sharegpt` → `prepared_train.jsonl` → `SFTTrainer` on a `text` field.

