# Always-active MoE audit (bugs only)

No code was changed. `alwaysActiveExperts` schema is **synced** between `engine/lib/projects.js` and `engine/bin/projects.js` (only unrelated drift: empty-name validation in lib). App runtime uses JS engine (`modelstudio-engine.js` → `../lib/projects`).

