## Verdict

Desktop splits quantization into **two different things**. **Train-time** quant (`qlora_4bit` / `lora_bf16`) is in the Model tab and wired into SFT. **Post-train GGUF** quant (`q4_k_m`, `q5_k_m`, etc.) lives in `quantize_export.py` + engine `quantize.start`, but **there is no Quantization tab and the UI never calls it**. SFT does **not** run GGUF as a post-step. **Q6_K is not supported** anywhere. Web has almost no GGUF/quant UI yet.

