  Q -->|no / Redis fail| Inline[inline-jobs.ts simulation]
  Bull --> Worker[apps/worker]
  Worker --> SimOrPy[Local Python or progress simulation]
  SimOrPy --> Artifact[artifact create]
  Artifact --> Settle[settleJobCost + refund unused hold]
  Worker -.->|intended| NovitaGPU[Novita instance + SSH train]
```

1. **Estimate** — `estimateJobCost` in `packages/config/src/pricing.ts` using Novita H300 $/hr × 1.10 + $5 flat fee.
2. **Start** — validate project/dataset (SFT) or ≥2 experts (MoE); create `Job`; `holdBalance`; set project `queued`.
3. **Queue** — if `USE_REDIS_QUEUE=1`, enqueue to BullMQ; else (or on failure) fire-and-forget **inline simulator**.
4. **Execute** — worker marks `running`, optionally logs Novita provision intent, tries local `train_sft.py`, else fake progress steps; creates artifact; refunds `holdCents - settledCents`.
5. **UI** — SSE at `/api/jobs/[id]/events` → `JobProgress`.

Deploy is parallel: `POST /api/artifacts/[id]/deploy` → `deploy-jobs` or inline scaffold.

