HexGridManager.cpp core geometry (per hex):
```cpp
// cap: top fan (center + 6 ring verts, normal up) + 6 side quads, thickness HexSize*0.10
// skirt: center + 6 corner verts at radius HexSize*1.02, corner Z = avg of this tile + 2 edge neighbors
const FVector C = AxialToWorld(T.Q, T.R, TerrainReliefZ(T) * 0.85f);
for (int32 k = 0; k < 6; ++k) {
    const float A0 = FMath::DegreesToRadians(60.f * k);
    // corner k shared with neighbors in edge dirs k-1 and k
    float CornerZ = (TerrainReliefZ(T) + TerrainReliefZ(N1) + TerrainReliefZ(N2)) / 3.f;
    Builder.AddTri(C, Corner[k], Corner[k+1]);
}
```
