Step 4 - UCivSimSubsystem (GameInstanceSubsystem). Loads civ_sim.dll via FPlatformProcess::GetDllHandle, resolving each export with GetDllExport into typed function pointers (so a missing export just disables that call). Search order: ProjectDir/Binaries/Win64/civ_sim.dll, ProjectDir/Plugins/CivSim/Binaries/Win64/civ_sim.dll, then the repo build output ../../target/release/civ_sim.dll. Public API: IsSimLoaded(), GenerateEarthMap(SizeId, Seed), HasMap(), DestroyMap(), GetMapDims(), GetTileData(q,r, FCivTileInfo&), PickSpawn(PlayerIndex, q, r), RevealFog(q,r,radius), GetFogState(q,r) -> ECivFogState. Missing DLL logs a warning and every call returns false gracefully; a successful load logs "CivSim loaded". Deinitialize destroys the map and frees the DLL handle.

