```powershell
cd "C:\Users\Waylon Brown\dev\VideoImage"
npm run setup:python
npm start
```

For the portable exe, run `setup_python.ps1` once so `.venv` exists next to the project (or beside the exe). Without that venv, the UI works but generation stays stub/offline-only.

